  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Make it so that when reporting a user in VRChat, it's possible to optionally take a screenshot to attach to the report. This would make reporting certain things such as avatars and other guideline-breaking behaviors significantly easier.\n\nAdditionally, it'd be interesting if a video or audio file could at least be recorded and attached.\n\nThis is partly inspired by the way Roblox goes about their reporting process as well, where a user can take a screenshot and highlight parts of the screenshot to point out the issue.",
